            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Redding, Ellie. (2016). Plotting the Wild West: Action and Description in the Dime Novel Western. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/vg776bv4406",
